srvpage_port=Listening port
srvpage_portwhy=The port appears in the server configuration, in the UPnP mapping and in every profile already issued. Changing it here updates all of them and restarts the server; editing the configuration by hand leaves a server that starts cleanly and is unreachable from every existing client.
